    "narrative": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "skills-as-markdown is cheap to write — and there's no compiler to tell you what you broke when you delete. June 15 pruned 20 skills in one commit (#473). June 19 needed four PRs (#503–#506) just to chase the dead names out of docs, manifests, and a dozen sibling skills. #506 left some dangling on purpose. the fix is a one-line linter aeon doesn't have yet.",
